    "summary": "fix(dev): staging guard for ignored paths + landing guard with resume + existing-work report (gh-1164)",
    "description": "## Three-part fix for the lost-work incident (fa gh-1164, runs 37153882406/37220167230)\n\n1. **Staging root fix**: git's ignored-pathspec guard fires on any literal pathspec naming an existing gitignored-untracked path — the static `:!factory-kit` pair was the live trip wire (timer autosave failed every 5 min for 40+ min, work never committed). factory-kit + extras now go through the same check-ignore probe (buildStagingPathspecs extraPaths / buildExclusionPathspecs), all six staging sites.\n2. **Landing guard (owner design)**: developTicketAndCreatePR verifies the branch carries work before the 'No Code Changes Needed' path; empty branch + claims-changes → feedbackLoop.resumeAgent with a targeted promptOverride; fallback unchanged.\n3. **Dev setup mirrors rework**: reportExistingDevBranch → input/<ticket>/existing_work.md (commit count vs base, shortstat, RESUMED-leg warning).\n\nTests: 8 new across 4 suites, all targeted suites green; repro verified red→green."
  }
}

